blad bundles third-party data.

City table (crates/blad-meta/data/cities.bin)
---------------------------------------------
Derived from the GeoNames geographical database, cities with population
>= 50,000, reduced to name, country code, coordinates and population.

  Source:  https://www.geonames.org
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The table is embedded so that reverse geocoding never requires a network
request. Photo coordinates are frequently someone's home; resolving them
through a web service would disclose that as a side effect of reading a
file's metadata.
